    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.46,
      "end_seconds": 25.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "it's been about four days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.07,
      "end_seconds": 32.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.09,
      "end_seconds": 47.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "pretty mild if I'm being honest. It settles a little with a warm shower"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.7,
      "end_seconds": 50.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "right, is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.69,
      "end_seconds": 61.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get tired eyes as well. The, The tired eyes? That's been for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.31,
      "end_seconds": 63.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.92,
      "end_seconds": 82.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "let me check a few things any weakness, blurred vision or sickness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.83,
      "end_seconds": 87.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "no, no weakness, blurred vision or sickness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.47,
      "end_seconds": 91.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Did you notice any sensitivity to light?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.49,
      "end_seconds": 95.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No sensitivity to light thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.6,
      "end_seconds": 99.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.9,
      "end_seconds": 108.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no joints are fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.02,
      "end_seconds": 113.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.63,
      "end_seconds": 121.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "It's, It's paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed. Hydrocortisone cream I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.41,
      "end_seconds": 126.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Right, tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.44,
      "end_seconds": 130.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Eczema, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.48,
      "end_seconds": 144.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "okay, I can see eczema in your file as well tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.48,
      "end_seconds": 158.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I walk the dog every morning. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.14,
      "end_seconds": 180.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.64,
      "end_seconds": 185.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Wheat. I come out in... well bloating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.88,
      "end_seconds": 190.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.89,
      "end_seconds": 203.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.32,
      "end_seconds": 229.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pressure 118 over 73, pulse 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.25,
      "end_seconds": 233.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.46,
      "end_seconds": 238.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.37,
      "end_seconds": 243.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "right, let's have a a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.73,
      "end_seconds": 245.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.64,
      "end_seconds": 267.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.69,
      "end_seconds": 274.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.37,
      "end_seconds": 308.57,
      "duration_seconds": 20.2,
      "text": "so so where does that leave us? It points towards tension-type headache. Eye strain is also on my list i'm going to order an eye test for Eye strain take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches please come and see me in four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.04,
      "end_seconds": 314.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "oh I'll book it on my way out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.31,
      "end_seconds": 320.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.79,
      "end_seconds": 326.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "so, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.45,
      "end_seconds": 333.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.09,
      "end_seconds": 337.22,
